{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_bibeak_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_bibeak_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "破殼",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bibeak_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fe0d612dc55308035a4b8fd4e0ba8abfa02128e3010d5b3b96247dda1cedbd0e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐......我、我還是有些緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都有第一次出任務的時候，不用這麼擔心啦，有我在的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你這幾天都泡在訓練室裡，你現在的劍術並不比誰差，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鉗獸......是很兇猛的東西吧？如果村子裡的人們都無法趕走它們，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不否認鉗獸的兇猛程度，但我敢打包票，如果拿鉗獸和堅雷教官的劍盾、杜賓教官的鞭子比，它們可能還真的比不上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能得到幾位教官的認可，被分配到這項外勤任務，就說明你的能力足以承擔起它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這只是一個開端，你不是也下了很久決心才決定報名的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——梓蘭姐，原來坐在這輛車上是這種感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才辦事處的幹員來找我們的時候，我還在想，要不還是等下次機會吧，但自己還是想要邁出這一步，就這麼把手舉起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久沒看到杜賓教官看著我笑了，我一定要好好地完成這次任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這把佩劍......我希望它和我都能保護更多的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這才對嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，梓蘭姐，能和我說說你第一次出任務的情形嗎？我想聽聽梓蘭姐的經驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，那是好久之前了。好像是我帶著小隊出去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那次任務結束後，我差點萌生了辭職的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好，他們後來漸漸地開始聽話了......可能吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原來幾位前輩是這樣的性格......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是羅德島派來的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對......我們是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙，你來和他們講一下我們的任務細節怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，我們是羅德島負責這次任務的小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次任務我們會先在村子外佈置上防禦工事，等結束後我們也會教給你們它的製造和佈置方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "防禦工事上還有相應的感應報警裝置，這樣就算以後再有鉗獸來襲，你們也可以提前做準備，村莊不至於會損失慘重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等鉗獸來了，我們會幫你們擊退它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，那......我還有點問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？您請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姑娘，你說話慢慢的，佩劍也細細的，羅德島為什麼派了你這樣的人來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的能打退鉗獸嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請您說話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以的，請您相信我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......我說話直，別介意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像您這樣有氣質的小姐，我以為只會待在家裡看書喝茶，哪做得了這種粗活，別到時候反而傷了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能來這裡幫我們，我們感激還來不及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧來吧，我屋子裡準備了茶和點心——村子裡自己做的，別嫌棄就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "茶很好喝，謝謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，自家種了點，這些都已經是去年的了。今年的茶田被鉗獸糟蹋，剩下的那點也根本種不了多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "日子難啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您沒有想過離開這裡，做點別的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能去哪呢，小姑娘？沒那麼容易啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工廠如今也要那些有學識的，我們這種，就守著這塊地，看看自己的子輩能做點什麼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。看幾位衣著都是有氣質的，是公子小姐閒了，來我們這裡磨煉磨煉的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也想著，幾位要是有什麼可以賺穩定薪資的門路，也千萬拜託給我們講講。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看我們這裡的情況，總覺得撐不了幾年......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們並不是什麼有錢人家的子弟，也不過是在公司裡謀生活罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但您要是真的有什麼困難，可以在結束後我們一起詳聊一下。或許我們能提供一定程度的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，謝謝，太謝謝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！喂！！望風的人看到鉗獸過來了！大家都拿上東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾位，我再多嘴一句，村子經不起再被它們糟蹋一波了，拜託幾位一定要幫我們趕走它們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們真的十分感謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家......請儘量站在高處！下面有我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姑娘，不用那麼擔心，我們和它們打過很多次了，多少有點經驗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們這些人可以幫你們幾個守住這邊！雖然比不上你們，但能分擔一點還是好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜託你們了！你們只要守住這裡的防禦工事就好，但千萬小心別被上面的法術誤傷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法術？你們還會法術啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是撿到寶了，我聽說外面厲害的術師一個人就能炸翻一棟樓，有你們在，我們這不是輕輕鬆鬆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大哥，別太樂觀，我沒有那麼厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會法術對我們來說就很厲害了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心點，懷特，帕迪，啟動盾牌上的源石回路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A&B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯！看起來真帶勁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這東西你們真的可以留給我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留一些工事遠比我們次次派人來援助要省時省力得多，你們學會了，也就不需要我們經常來幫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好事嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們可真是好人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐小心，它們已經湊過來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傷到哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肩膀被劃到了，沒事......我可以處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "柏喙用被撕碎的布料簡單地包紮住傷口，露出了原本被作戰服包裹住的脖子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（你......你看她脖子上，是源石嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（什麼？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（*粗口*！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你、你們是......感染者嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還真是！你身上那些，就是石頭吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我——我拜託你們，走遠些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們真是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死的，那我們剛才還在一起喝了茶！我會不會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鉗獸、鉗獸——這群鉗獸為什麼只過來打我們，你們倒是把感染者打出去啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一位村民從家中拿出了氣味濃郁的食物，丟向小隊所在的位置。\n鉗獸循著氣味爬了過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去咬他們啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——我寧願被鉗獸吃光家裡的東西，也不想得這病！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是怎麼來到這裡的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你們請——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒請感染者來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我們不是在幫你們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛還請我們去你家裡......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那是因為我不知道你們是感染者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你騙了我們！你們把身上的源石藏得嚴嚴實實，誰能看得出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走啊！你們走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鉗獸，趕走他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們現在突然說這些？！礦石病並不會透過日常接觸傳播！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是感染者，我和他們一起工作好幾年了，我一點事都沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是感染者？你更是個瘋子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比爾就是不知怎麼就得了這種病，長了石頭以後就沒地方留他做活，最苦的底層礦廠都不願意收他，他沒處去，就這麼死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他死之後還、還......我們村子就是因為感染者完蛋的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們居然敢大搖大擺地就這麼直接進我們村子？你是不是想讓我們都得病死掉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是來幫我們的，還是來害我們的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出去！你們都出去！我們不需要你們來幫我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐，你是隊長，下令吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是忍不了了！在這裡平白挨罵是為什麼，居然還把鉗獸往我們這裡引！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙，打退這一隻，我們就走吧。他們做出了這樣的決定，我們也沒有必要硬留在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從高處往下撤，你從防禦工事後繞路，我們在車子旁邊會合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們為什麼要離開，以一種被趕走的方式......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們沒有做錯什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們明明是來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "另一塊帶有濃郁氣味的食物砸了過來，落在柏喙腳邊。周圍的鉗獸嗅到了香氣，掉轉方向向她爬來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "梓蘭用源石技藝勉強擊退柏喙四周的鉗獸，讓它們一時不敢再靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙，這種事情我遇到過幾次。很多人可能根本沒有仔細閱讀羅德島的支援說明，只是想得到一些幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但現在這種情況對我們十分不利，我們在這裡繼續待下去，可能還會引起他們的憤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萬一有人做出什麼激進行為只會更糟糕，我建議我們撤退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是擔心任務失敗嗎，柏喙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐，這是我第一次外勤任務，我不想就這麼放棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且——我們並沒有做錯什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能理解，我幫了他們，卻要被他們趕走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我之前看到鉗獸就會害怕地躲到父母身後，看到傷害自己的人就只想我應該怎麼辦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我......我，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想走！我不想就這樣......被趕走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鉗獸不再懼怕梓蘭釋放出的源石技藝，試探性地邁出了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "柏喙揮下一劍。\n她想斬斷什麼——她曾面對憤怒的人群保護身後的人，也曾在訓練場裡揮下無數劍。\n但今天這劍她只是想為了自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這樣做，就因為我是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......難道我是感染者，我就比那些會撕碎你們住處的鉗獸更可惡、更可怕，值得你們退開這麼遠的距離嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便我們已經說了，我們......並不會把礦石病傳染給你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "村民們沒有人回答。\n鉗獸彷彿沒有盡頭一般，衝破了村莊前的防禦工事。\n柏喙沒有挪動雙腿，她只是站在這裡，拿著她那柄細細的劍，抬手，揮下，咬緊牙關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......還是個倔丫頭。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這是把這次任務看成對自己的一個證明了......其實可以不用這樣委屈自己的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（但你要這麼想的話......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙，你要真的想這麼做，我來幫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但不要這麼拼，你已經受傷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死的，鉗獸要衝進來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別再後退了，我們必須要在這裡把鉗獸攔住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家裡有弩的，有工具的，都別在後面躲著了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "門窗鎖緊，再確認一遍自己的鎖牢不牢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "越來越多的鉗獸湧向村莊，數量遠超了人們一開始的估計。\n一個接著一個的村民走出房門，站到了前面來。\n已經回撤的幾位幹員看著沉默不語只是揮劍的柏喙，大歎一口氣，重新拿起了扔在腳邊的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......*粗話*算了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐，我和帕迪去重新加固一下防禦工事，要不然這樣下去大夥都玩完！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我......你們別過來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我的腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受傷了就退下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你別過來......！我自己站起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，我也沒想著扶你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "防禦工事立起來了！梓蘭姐，柏喙，躲過來些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這東西沒完沒了，我就不信了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的身後！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝兄弟！呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說廢話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之多謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別光站著，做點事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "光看著我們幹嘛？嘴上說著愛村子，現在就看著他們幾個感染者在前面打？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再說一遍，只是一般的接觸不會造成感染！你們要是真的想把鉗獸趕走，就站到前面來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*粗話*，我豁出去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給你這個！但、但你就站在那別過來......我扔給你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別磨磨蹭蹭的，你要真怕可以不給，我又沒逼你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是怕，我就是怕！但我......我得有點良心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們救了我，我起碼心裡得對得起我自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我們自己做的氣味包，裡面的味道鉗獸不喜歡，應該能派上用場！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給——接著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懷特，你注意著點那邊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚恐的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一聲尖叫讓所有人都轉過了頭，一個小女孩指著柏喙所在的方向，驚恐無比。\n柏喙身後，一隻鉗獸已經舉起了利爪，柏喙試圖舉起劍，但似乎是由於疲勞，沒有成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一隻弩箭穿透了鉗獸的身軀，在它的爪鉗即將刺向柏喙的身體時。\n持弩的村民伸手護住自己驚恐的女兒，沒有說什麼，她只是在下一瞬繼續看向新的一隻鉗獸，拉滿了弦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙！你沒事吧？！你先退到後面休——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐，沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後面，後面又衝過來了啊啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別再亂喊了！有時間過來把工事撐住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來、來了！嗯......我不怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有力氣的，過來幫幫他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有囤的那些土炮都拿上來，多少起點作用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "從下午到傍晚，愚鈍的鉗獸似乎意識到了前方為死路，它們並不應該繼續前行，逐漸退去。\n人們停下發痠的手，怔怔地站在原地，還沒有從上一刻的拼殺中回過神來。\n柏喙把劍拄在地上，用它支撐著身體，隨後轉過身，走向羅德島停在遠處的車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙！走，快回車上，我給你處理傷口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "村民們站在原地，有的人躊躇著想邁出一步，但最終停了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島外勤幹員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，那個，幾位......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉......也謝謝你們。我們家裡還有之前準備的飯，天也晚了，我給你們拿上，路上吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用了，就到這裡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐，我想吃你做的那個點心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是帶了一點來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，帶了，就在車上放著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們走吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，我給你包紮好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忍得很辛苦吧？哭出來了就好，哭出來了就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你已經很勇敢了，對不對？你不是一開始就哭著跑回車上，而是擊退了所有鉗獸，自己走回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你讓那些村民漸漸改變了想法，和我們一起作戰的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然以我們其他人的決定，大家只會馬上轉身離開，回去的時候罵一路解氣，什麼都不會改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我無數次地告訴我自己，我不能沉浸在怨恨裡，我不能讓我自己變成一副可怕的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在別人眼中，在那些沒有染病的普通人眼裡，我就是一副可怕的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......可是，我覺得，他們其實......沒有錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙，你......可以不用這樣安慰自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的支援說明上寫了我們的小隊成員包含感染者，是他們沒有看。起碼，他們可以用一種更體面的方式，我們不是不能接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......梓蘭姐，我是真心這樣覺得，他們的害怕理所應當，因為我也害怕，我也怨恨，我很恐懼我的病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我離開了我的宅子，來這裡抑制我的病情，又參加了那麼多次的訓練，得到了這樣一個機會，我能戰勝我的恐懼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許其他人不一定能吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不想我做了這麼多，卻在第一次外勤任務就停下來，甚至再退回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但我是不是有些自私了？如果他們真的很恐懼，我不應該......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柏喙，躺下歇歇吧，先不要想那麼多了，吃點東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們因為不瞭解礦石病才感到恐懼，但我們說明了僅僅是一般的接觸並不會造成感染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後面他們冷靜下來，也接受了這個事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他們下回還會請求羅德島的幫助嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，下回他們仍舊選擇了求助羅德島......我還會願意接下任務嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就看你自己的選擇了，柏喙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每個人都有自己的選擇。比如我，我可能會猶豫很久......然後再拒絕吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我現在還不知道我以後的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有可能下一次他們就不再懼怕我們了，也有可能下一次他們仍舊排斥，或者根本就不會有下一次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我會等著那樣一天的到來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（遞上了點心）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭姐，謝謝你今天陪我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然，我可能會做傻事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我......不後悔申請參加這次外勤任務，即便它和我想像的很不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "speakerId": "avg_252_bibeak_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會繼續堅持下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "aliases": [
        "梓蘭"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
